    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the heart of a feline's life and discover this new animal world ! Born into a protective family, you will take your first steps there before discovering new horizons and adventures filled with surprises.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681490/extras/1f98f32eef9c3088eb3dfc00714cd06f.avif?t=1663104717\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681490/extras/4e961371226a720833cd7834e6ef8ea4.poster.avif?t=1663104717\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681490/extras/4e961371226a720833cd7834e6ef8ea4.webm?t=1663104717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681490/extras/4e961371226a720833cd7834e6ef8ea4.mp4?t=1663104717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong> Discover the mysteries of Pandora - </strong> Reveal the secrets of this land, solve puzzles and meet friends along the way.<br></li><li> <strong> Explore a new world - </strong> This land is the home of the last resources, adapt yourself to this environment to increase your chances of survival.<br></li><li> <strong> Evolve with scarce resources - </strong> Hunt and get skill points to get stronger. Become the strongest predator or the most agile as you please.<br></li><li> <strong> Meet your soul mate - </strong> During your explorations, you will have the chance to meet felines of your species, try your talents of seduction to find your ideal partner.<br></li><li> <strong> Start a family - </strong> Once you have found your soul mate, start a family and raise your little ones with it. Protect them from danger and starvation.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681490/extras/cd4bc81fbe5559e41f46d856d60b5b06.avif?t=1663104717\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681490/extras/6877d6c7d0528a5e022615ccbbe210fc.poster.avif?t=1663104717\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681490/extras/6877d6c7d0528a5e022615ccbbe210fc.webm?t=1663104717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681490/extras/6877d6c7d0528a5e022615ccbbe210fc.mp4?t=1663104717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Hunt 7 creatures that have been discovered on this earth:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Boars</strong>, Slow But Reckless,<br></li><li> <strong>Rabbits</strong>, Fragile But Fast,<br></li><li> <strong>Fawns</strong>, still babies, it make them a very easy prey,<br></li><li> <strong>Fallow deer</strong>, more robust and swift,<br></li><li> <strong>Deer</strong>, prey of choice but very difficult to catch,<br></li><li> <strong>Bears</strong>, very dreadful, it's better not to approach them before being strong enough,<br></li><li> <strong>Other felines</strong>, like you, among which you will choose your partner.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1681490/extras/d138fc28bf39cca313b79423a0f94420.avif?t=1663104717\" /></div><br><br>It's in the south of the island of Pandora that you are born into a loving family, but whose territory is not very prosperous.<br>After taking your first steps, you will discover this mysterious place where there is no trace of human presence.<br>You will notice that the fauna has adapted to this limited environment in order to survive and share the last resources of this land.<br>Despit